OL,3,GNEWSAVictim of Krakow gun attack
OL,4,Areturns home to York
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man shot in the Krakow attack
OL,7,Fearlier this month is on his way home
OL,8,Fafter receiving treatment in hospital,
OL,9,Fhis family have said.
OL,11,FHarry Marchant, from York, suffered a
OL,12,Fgunshot wound in the Polish city's busy
OL,13,FMain Market Square on 7 November.
OL,15,FThe York City supporter, whose 20th
OL,16,Fbirthday was on Wednesday, was one of
OL,17,F15 people injured in the attack, which
OL,18,Fkilled one British man.
OL,20,FMarchant's family said that he had been
OL,21,Fdischarged from hospital and was
OL,22,Freturning home "via ambulance".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
